			"notes": "## Changes\n\nNew\n- Job calculator: pick your mines and gear and see the total mats and credits, with prices from the shop\n- Rate over: mats/h and EXP/h over the last 30 sec, 1, 2, 5 or 10 min (Settings → Extras). It stops dropping a few seconds after you stop mining so you can read it\n- EXP per hour in the Mining panel\n- Beacon Mine timer with a warning at the top of the screen before it resets\n- Outpost timers\n- New settings menu layout\n\n## Which jar do I need?\n\nPick the jar that matches your Minecraft version, and put it in your Fabric mods folder\ntogether with Fabric API.\n\n| Minecraft | Jar |\n|---|---|\n| 1.21.11 | `minerefine-mod-1.6.6+1.21.11.jar` |\n| 26.1 – 26.1.2 | `minerefine-mod-1.6.6+26.1.2.jar` |\n| 26.2 | `minerefine-mod-1.6.6+26.2.jar` |"
